    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "iMOVE Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 27 Fairview Close to the market.\r\n\r\nThis bright, warm and generously proportioned one-bedroom apartment is ideally positioned on the second floor of this well-maintained and highly sought-after development. Offering spacious accommodation and an abundance of natural light throughout, this superb property is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, investors or those seeking a convenient city home.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway leading to a spacious open-plan living and dining area, flooded with natural light and complemented by a modern fitted kitchen. The large double bedroom offers excellent storage, while a well-appointed family bathroom completes the accommodation.\r\n\r\nFurther benefits include a designated underground parking space and a private storage unit, providing valuable additional storage.\r\n\r\nFairview Close enjoys an exceptional location with an array of amenities right on its doorstep. The vibrant villages of Fairview and Drumcondra offer an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, pubs, supermarkets, boutiques and recreational facilities. The property is also ideally situated just 1.5km from Dublin City Centre and within easy reach of the IFSC, Beaumont Hospital, the Mater Hospital, DCU and St. Patrick's Campus, all easily accessible by car, bicycle or the excellent public transport links available nearby.\r\n\r\nCombining spacious accommodation with an unbeatable location, No. 27 Fairview Close is sure to appeal to a wide range of discerning purchasers and early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
